# Changes to these paths need an approving review from a code owner who is not the PR's author.
# The `main` ruleset enforces it and dismisses the approval when a later push changes the diff.
# `.github/workflows/AGENTS.md` ("Code owners") explains the scopes.
# `@pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin` is not an owner: it also holds repo admins outside the Pydantic AI team, so its admins are named instead.

